timestamp=2026-11-09T09:00:19.857Z level=INFO run=7904429e message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Check task ids that appear in timesheet but not in tasks.csv\nimport csv\nimport ast\n\ntasks = set()\nwith open('/app/dataset/tasks.csv') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for row in reader:\n        tasks.add(row['task_id'])\n\nbad_tasks = set()\nwith open('/app/dataset/timesheet.csv') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for row in reader:\n        try:\n            tlist = ast.literal_eval(row['performed_tasks'])\n            for t in tlist:\n                if str(t) not in tasks:\n                    bad_tasks.add(str(t))\n        except:\n            pass\n\nprint(sorted(bad_tasks))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
